.TH TBRIDGE 1 "2026-10-26" "tbridge 1.0.0" "TermuxBridge"
.SH NAME
tbridge \- TermuxBridge 命令行 (Termux:API 风格)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tbridge
.I command
.RI [ args ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
通过显式广播 lll.bridge.termux.CMD 调用 TermuxBridge Android 应用 (应用连回本进程的
127.0.0.1 端口回包), 获取系统能力:
通知、剪贴板、传感器、定位、TTS/STT、截图、模拟触控、UI 树导出。
.SH ENVIRONMENT
TBRIDGE_TOKEN, TBRIDGE_TIMEOUT.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B tbridge-overlay
show, update, animate, hide, events (--since/--wait), values, list, bounds,
tree, stats, perm, demo.
.TP
.B tbridge-acc
Accessibility event mode (none, window, content, both) and counters.
.TP
.B tbridge-panic
status, stop \- cut overlay, accessibility, listener and service at once.
.TP
.B tbridge-notif
status, recent, clear, perm, dismiss, cancel, channels, channel.
.TP
.B tbridge-ime
status, commit, show, hide, pick, rime (passthrough to the Termux rime daemon).
.TP
.B tbridge-text
Write the focused field; -g reads it, -d dumps diagnostics.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
tbridge-toast "构建完成"
tbridge-notification -t 备份 -c "已完成"
tbridge-screenshot ~/screen.png
tbridge-sensor -s accelerometer
.fi
